9618668.355500","parent_user_id":"U7B4ZD49X","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Au"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7bf2894-9cea-40bb-83de-94f2db074c31","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"生鮮食品は多少地域差が出るかとは思う","ts":"1619575387.308900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BS78T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51c2bfd9-fd30-4a87-bc9e-a12db0d22e21","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"物価っていっても日本内で差があるのって家賃くらいなイメージだけど・・・","ts":"1619575339.308600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I4W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf17727c-1e57-4a59-a435-9e536c265308","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なるほなるほ\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%BA%E7%A8%BC%E3%81%8E#%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AA%E3%83%94%E3%83%B3%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AB%E3%82%88%E3%82%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%87%BA%E7%A8%BC%E3%81%8E\u003e","ts":"1619575142.307700","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: 出稼ぎ","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"出稼ぎ","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%BA%E7%A8%BC%E3%81%8E#%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AA%E3%83%94%E3%83%B3%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AB%E3%82%88%E3%82%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%87%BA%E7%A8%BC%E3%81%8E","text":"出稼ぎ（でかせぎ）は、所得の低い地域や就職先の少ない地域に在住する者が、単身で、所得が高く就職先も多い地域で就労すること。定住地から離れた場所での労働を示し、この移動労働により得た所得の一部は定住地の家族に送金する場合が多いとされている。明治時代から昭和初期には「季節労働」・「出稼」の表記もみえるが、近年の日本の公文書では、「出かせぎ」を用いている（平成22年の国勢調査票の添付書類より）。\n近代以降、多くの日系人が中南米に移民し、その子孫が後に経済発展した日本へ出稼ぎに向かったことから、中南米でも「デカセギ」（スペイン語: dekasegi、ポルトガル語: decasségui）と表現されることがある。\n店舗を持たず商品を売りながら移動する仕事は行商を、同じ勤務先に在籍したまま家族を帯同せず違う土地へ転勤することは単身赴任を、家族を連れて別の地域へ移り住むことは移住を、その向かう先が海外である場合は移民を参照。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/Japan_dekasegitetyou.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%BA%E7%A8%BC%E3%81%8E#%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AA%E3%83%94%E3%83%B3%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AB%E3%82%88%E3%82%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%87%BA%E7%A8%BC%E3%81%8E","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%BA%E7%A8%BC%E3%81%8E#%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AA%E3%83%94%E3%83%B3%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AB%E3%82%88%E3%82%8B%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%96%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%87%BA%E7%A8%BC%E3%81%8E"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LPrbl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4603eaca-a8f1-448a-a4e1-c53d7960c5c9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"シンガポール出稼ぎとか、ドバイ出稼ぎとかはあるだろうけど\nただ、搾取的な場合が話題になりやすいから、イコールかというと実体としてどうなんだろう...","ts":"1619575142.307600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sPJ+Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15a1218c-ba94-4f17-96e0-979bde0237ea","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ていうかこれが「出稼ぎ」…？","ts":"1619575105.306800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L6Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9F34BF13-802B-4228-A8C4-7563DB9C215D","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"フィリピンではそれを Overseas Filipino Worker (OFW) と言って、国家として推奨していますね。\n\u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overseas_Filipino_Worker|https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overseas_Filipino_Worker\u003e","ts":"1619574997.306200","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: Overseas Filipino Worker","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/","title":"Overseas Filipino Worker","title_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overseas_Filipino_Worker","text":"Overseas Filipino Worker (OFW) is a term often used to refer to Filipino migrant workers, people with Filipino citizenship who reside in another country for a limited period of employment. There are over 10 million Filipinos working abroad, making the Philippines \"one of the biggest export countries of labour\".","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/Filipino_Men_at_Work_in_Brunei.jpg/1200px-Filipino_Men_at_Work_in_Brunei.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overseas_Filipino_Worker","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overseas_Filipino_Worker"}],"edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1619575067.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lXr1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ee3a404-0c4f-4222-9475-89d4c3d7671f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"東京の物価で稼いで地方の実家に送る基礎的ライフハック\n\n突き詰めたらもっとやれることあるけどそれはそれ","ts":"1619574276.305100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8S/a"}]}]
